  "findings": [
    "Native luautils.walkAdj calls character square canReachTo and queues the native walk action; the ledger repeats reach validation on authority.",
    "Native ISAddTakeDispenserBottle.complete demonstrates server-side AddItem and sendAddItemToContainer. The ledger adds per-input grants/journals and exact membership checks.",
    "Native ItemContainer.Remove(InventoryItem) removes the list entry but does not clear the container pointer; conversion verifies actual item membership, not just getContainer.",
    "Native timed action duration conversion inspected in the same 25485521 JAR uses 20ms units. Ledger seconds map to 50 native units; actual modifiers/fast-forward remain runtime gates.",
    "Shared custom class reconstruction retains the server-owned action. Native getProgress and an authenticated owner challenge guard completion; no client complete RPC exists.",
    "Native power uses haveElectricity OR hasGridPower plus indoor room, matching installed charger Lua. Only the confirmed stock desktop sprite is offered.",
    "Actual Rooms canAccessAt requires a loaded source square; historical unloaded reads use stricter native membership and Rooms validated registry/private-storage helpers. Helpers are read-only and feature-checked; no upstream changes.",
    "Paper/notebook, pen/pencil, vanilla CD, desktop, icon/model, B42 in-hand recipe and retained-input references were verified. No copied native assets or Java runtime component is shipped."
  ]
